WEBVTT

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.440
<i>Dear Onee-sama,</i>

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:11.610
<i>today, I failed to get the spinach that was on sale.</i>

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.700
<i>Am I really qualified to be your younger sister?</i>

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:22.390
<i>You must hate your little sister who fails repeatedly, after all.</i>

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:28.040
<i>No matter how hard I try, it’s never enough to make you notice.</i>

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.300
<i>Yamada Kyou,</i>

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.330
<i>Yamada Asu, huh…</i>

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:50.100
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:53.790
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.600
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:02.810
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:04.930
This is our home.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.620
But, when spring comes…

